          <attvalue for="34" value="0.6" />
          <attvalue for="35" value="Escalating AI-related export controls and compliance enforcement drive onshoring and stockpiling of critical chips and associated metals and inputs, producing localized bottlenecks and raising assessed supply-disruption risk for energy- and metals-related commodity chains." />
          <attvalue for="36" value="6-18 months" />
