          <attvalue for="28" value="2" />
          <attvalue for="34" value="0.65" />
          <attvalue for="35" value="Declines in public trust in institutions incentivize governments to exert more formal and informal pressure on private communications providers to control narratives and limit disruptive content related to the conflict." />
